WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.021 line:88%
Assalomu alaykum! Men Malika. Bugun
— gigiyena va xavfsizlik haqida.

2
00:00:06.241 --> 00:00:10.493 line:88%
Ofitsiant — taom va mehmon
o‘rtasidagi oxirgi halqa.

3
00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:15.912 line:88%
Asosiy yo‘l — qo‘l: iflos
idishdan toza stakanga.

4
00:00:16.132 --> 00:00:19.717 line:88%
Toza va ishlatilgan idish bitta patnisda.

5
00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:23.886 line:88%
Bitta latta bilan stol
ham, patnis ham artilsa.

6
00:00:24.106 --> 00:00:28.175 line:88%
Yo‘tal va aksirish — taom
tomonga emas, tirsakka.

7
00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:32.504 line:88%
Qo‘lni ho‘llang va sovun oling.

8
00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:37.036 line:88%
Ishqalang: barmoqlar orasi,
bosh barmoq, tirnoq osti.

9
00:00:37.256 --> 00:00:41.144 line:88%
Chaying va bir martalik
sochiq bilan quriting.

10
00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:45.373 line:88%
Jo‘mrakni qo‘l bilan emas
— sochiq bilan yoping.

11
00:00:46.723 --> 00:00:51.035 line:88%
Qo‘l yuviladi: iflos ishdan
keyin, toza ishdan oldin.

12
00:00:51.255 --> 00:00:54.901 line:88%
Hojatxonadan keyin — har doim, istisnosiz.

13
00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:59.372 line:88%
Antiseptik yuvish o‘rnini
bosmaydi — uni to‘ldiradi.

14
00:01:00.722 --> 00:01:04.974 line:88%
Ertalab Malikada isitma va
qorin og‘rig‘i boshlandi.

15
00:01:05.194 --> 00:01:09.870 line:88%
— Menda isitma bor, qornim
og‘riyapti. Bugun ishlay olmayman.

16
00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:14.099 line:88%
— To‘g‘ri qildingiz. Dam
oling, shifokorga boring.

17
00:01:14.319 --> 00:01:18.995 line:88%
Belgini yashirib ishlash —
mehmon va hamkasblar uchun xavf.

18
00:01:20.345 --> 00:01:25.445 line:88%
Toza idish: alohida patnis, og‘izga
tegadigan joyga qo‘l tegmaydi.

19
00:01:25.665 --> 00:01:29.916 line:88%
Ishlatilgan idish: alohida
joy, keyin qo‘l yuviladi.

20
00:01:30.136 --> 00:01:34.085 line:88%
Stoldan qaytgan non boshqa
mehmonga berilmaydi.

21
00:01:35.435 --> 00:01:38.595 line:88%
Xizmat paytida vilka yerga tushdi.

22
00:01:38.815 --> 00:01:41.855 line:88%
Uni artib qaytarish mumkin emas!

23
00:01:42.075 --> 00:01:45.478 line:88%
— Kechirasiz! Hozir tozasini keltiraman.

24
00:01:45.698 --> 00:01:49.949 line:88%
Qo‘l tozalanadi, yangi vilka
dastasidan keltiriladi.

25
00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:54.278 line:88%
— Ehtiyot bo‘ling, tarelka issiq!

26
00:01:54.498 --> 00:01:57.598 line:88%
— Rahmat, ogohlantirganingiz uchun.

27
00:01:57.818 --> 00:02:02.372 line:88%
Issiq idish — quruq salfetkada,
mehmon yonidan uzatiladi.

28
00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:07.004 line:88%
Suv to‘kildi. Joyni tashlab ketmang!

29
00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:10.809 line:88%
Belgi qo‘ying va odamlarni ogohlantiring.

30
00:02:11.029 --> 00:02:15.099 line:88%
Quruq holatgacha arting
va mas’ulga xabar bering.

31
00:02:16.449 --> 00:02:21.246 line:88%
Joyni to‘sing, supurgi bilan
yig‘ing, alohida idishga soling.

32
00:02:21.466 --> 00:02:25.293 line:88%
Qo‘l bilan termang va
oddiy qopga tashlamang.

33
00:02:25.513 --> 00:02:29.583 line:88%
Yonidagi ochiq muz va taom
to‘liq almashtiriladi.

34
00:02:30.933 --> 00:02:35.427 line:88%
Xavfni ko‘rdingizmi — yonidan
o‘tib ketmang, to‘xtating.

35
00:02:35.647 --> 00:02:39.838 line:88%
Belgilang va mas’ulga
ayting: qayerda, nima bo‘ldi.

36
00:02:40.058 --> 00:02:43.097 line:88%
Tez yordam — 103, yong‘in — 101.

37
00:02:44.447 --> 00:02:48.577 line:88%
Takrorlaymiz: toza qo‘l,
sog‘lom xodim, ikki oqim.

38
00:02:48.797 --> 00:02:54.564 line:88%
Tushgan narsa almashtiriladi, xavf
belgilanadi, issiq haqida ogohlantiriladi.

39
00:02:54.784 --> 00:02:59.823 line:88%
Keyingi mavzu — stol servirovkasi
va taom uzatish. Ko‘rishguncha!
